body":"Steps to reproduce:\r\n\r\n1. Download this 18-second video - https://uloz.to/file/DRkfa60ecVdz/aircraft-mts . Play the video on your computer, it should play smooth.\r\n2. Open a new project in Shotcut, leave video mode on automatic, no proxy.\r\n3. Import the aircraft.mts into the Playlist\r\n4. In the Source player set the IN point to 15:10 and leave the OUT point at 18:10 (that makes a 3 sec clip)\r\n5. Put this 3-sec clip TWO times on the timeline so that we have one cut (that will be enough for our need)\r\nYour Shotcut should look like this now:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9153595/102723695-0ce4fe80-430a-11eb-9084-dcc2cfd03d29.png)\r\n\r\n6. Now play the video on the Timeline and focus on the cut between these two clips - **right after the cut the video is frozen for about one second**.\r\n7. Export the video to MJPEG - the same is in the exported file.\r\n\r\n---\r\nWindows 10 Pro, version 2004\r\nShotcut 20.11.28\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"PontiacCZ","id":9153595,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNTM1OTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9153595?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PontiacCZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PontiacCZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mltframework/shot